    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Storefront &amp; Conversion</strong>
        Product pages, collection and search, cart and checkout. Identify and fix the problems that are costing you revenue.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Catalog &amp; Merchandising</strong>
        Clean product data so that it is pristine and invites the consumer to convert. Product recommendations, search, and merchandising that actually works.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Operations &amp; Integrations</strong>
        Orders, inventory, fulfillment, returns, and the connections to your ERP, 3PL, and accounting.
        I can help improve operational efficency by removing bottlenecks and automating manual processes.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Platform Strategy &amp; Replatforming</strong>
        Stay, extend, or move &mdash; I can provide a migration plan that protects
        your URLs, your rankings, and your order history when the answer is move.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics &amp; Lifecycle</strong>
        If it moves, measure it. I can help you understand what the numbers are telling you, and how to use that information to improve your store.
      </li>
